OUTCOME
- Implemented the sole installed multifloor_manager_node.py and package-local ROS adapter.
- Added an epoch-owned snapshot store. All tag/map/AMCL/costmap callbacks reduce observations into immutable snapshots and return false when their epoch is terminal.
- Added bounded change_map, initial-pose/request_nomotion_update, and clear_costmaps operations.
- The runner calls all configured producers against one immutable snapshot and passes that evidence to tron1_condition_engine.evaluate_cycle. There is no callback readiness gate after or beside the explicit root.
- Action feedback preserves ARM_TARGET, CHANGE_MAP, MAP_CONFIRM, INITIALPOSE, AMCL_READY, CLEAR_COSTMAPS, COSTMAP_READY, POLICY_READY.
- Success is emitted only for EvaluationCycle.result. Cancellation and operation failure finish FAULT/PREEMPTED or FAULT/ABORTED, invalidate the epoch, and reject late callback writes.
- Project-generated ROS imports in ros_node.py are exactly tron1_interfaces.msg. No old capability-generated type is imported.

